<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日哭笑不得 - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%93%AD%E7%AC%91%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%93%AD%E7%AC%91%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日哭笑不得 要窜访日本，遂申请签证儿。 在xjp申请日本签证…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112519308533402974/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112519308533402974/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%93%AD%E7%AC%91%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日哭笑不得&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;/p>&lt;p>要窜访日本，遂申请签证儿。&lt;/p>&lt;p>在xjp申请日本签证儿要在网上先预约，然而预约名额很抢手，早满了。&lt;/p>&lt;p>抱着试试看的态度，我打开了F12到处鼓捣，试图搞个API用程序查询，发现放出名额就通知我。&lt;/p>&lt;p>没想到鼓捣鼓捣竟然进入了一个奇怪的页面儿，本来没有名额的日期刷出了名额 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> &lt;/p>&lt;p>顺着点过去发现能继续，只不过界面变成了日语 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/aa653413e41c8f7de0de.png" alt=":wdg:" title=":wdg:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 在股沟翻译的帮助下竟然预约成功了 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> &lt;/p>&lt;p>或许那是给旅行社儿预留的名额儿被我偷了一个？ &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/4d5143941690f7df78d3.png" alt=":psyduck:" title=":psyduck:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p>
